ded-md\">地域: 全国（鹿児島妙見・群馬法師＆東吾妻・栃木湯西川＆塩原・京都美山・徳島祖谷・岐阜奥飛騨・熊本黒川・新潟湯沢）</span>\n    <span class=\"px-2 py-1 bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-md\">更新日: 2026年最新版</span>\n    <span class=\"px-2 py-1 bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-md\">即時予約・公式連携</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n  \n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ あわせて読みたい！テーマ別＆全国厳選特集</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900\">💎 テーマ別キラー特集</h4>\n      <a href=\"/posts/private-in-room-dining-luxury-onsen-hotels-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700\">👉 お部屋食が嬉しいおすすめ高級温泉旅館10選</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/charcoal-hearth-brand-pork-kagoshima-hotels-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700\">👉 ブランド豚が美味しいおすすめ温泉宿10選</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/chloride-hot-spring-warming-moisturizing-hotels-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700\">👉 塩化物泉が自慢のおすすめ美肌温泉宿10選</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900\">🎌 全47都道府県の厳選特集</h4>\n      <a href=\"/posts/gunma-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-orange-700\">🏨 【群馬・草津望雲お部屋食上州牛】厳選10選ガイド</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/hyogo-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-orange-700\">🏨 【兵庫・城崎西村屋本館お部屋食但馬牛】厳選10選ガイド</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/kagoshima-hot